{
  "sutta_id": "MN98",
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "pali": "Majjhima Nikāya 98 ",
      "english": "Middle Discourses 98 "
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "pali": "Vāseṭṭhasutta ",
      "english": "With Vāseṭṭha "
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
      "english": "So I have heard. "
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe. ",
      "english": "At one time the Buddha was staying in a forest near Icchānaṅgala. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā icchānaṅgale paṭivasanti, seyyathidaṁ—",
      "english": "Now at that time several very well-known well-to-do brahmins were residing in Icchānaṅgala. They included "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "caṅkī brāhmaṇo, tārukkho brāhmaṇo, pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo, jāṇussoṇi brāhmaṇo, todeyyo brāhmaṇo, aññe ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā. ",
      "english": "the brahmins Caṅkī, Tārukkha, Pokkharasāti, Jānussoṇi, Todeyya, and others. "
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājānaṁ māṇavānaṁ jaṅghāvihāraṁ anucaṅkamantānaṁ anuvicarantānaṁ ayamantarākathā udapādi: ",
      "english": "Then as the students Vāseṭṭha and Bhāradvāja were going for a walk they began to discuss the question: "
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "“kathaṁ, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti? ",
      "english": "“How do you become a brahmin?” "
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "Bhāradvājo māṇavo evamāha: ",
      "english": "Bhāradvāja said this: "
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "“yato kho, bho, ubhato sujāto mātito ca pitito ca saṁsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena—",
      "english": "“When you’re well born on both your mother’s and father’s side, of pure descent, with irrefutable and impeccable genealogy back to the seventh paternal generation—"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti. ",
      "english": "then you’re a brahmin.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "Vāseṭṭho māṇavo evamāha: ",
      "english": "Vāseṭṭha said this: "
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "“yato kho, bho, sīlavā ca hoti vattasampanno ca—",
      "english": "“When you’re ethical and accomplished in doing your duties—"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti. ",
      "english": "then you’re a brahmin.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "pali": "Neva kho asakkhi bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhaṁ māṇavaṁ saññāpetuṁ, na pana asakkhi vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṁ māṇavaṁ saññāpetuṁ. ",
      "english": "But neither was able to persuade the other. "
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "Atha kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṁ māṇavaṁ āmantesi: ",
      "english": "So Vāseṭṭha said to Bhāradvāja, "
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "“ayaṁ kho, bho bhāradvāja, samaṇo gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe. ",
      "english": "“Worthy Bhāradvāja, the ascetic Gotama—a Sakyan, gone forth from a Sakyan family—is staying in a forest near Icchānaṅgala. "
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "Taṁ kho pana bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato: ",
      "english": "He has this good reputation: "
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "pali": "‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’ti. ",
      "english": "‘That Blessed One is perfected, a fully awakened Buddha, accomplished in knowledge and conduct, holy, knower of the world, supreme guide for those fit for training, teacher of gods and humans, awakened, blessed.’ "
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "pali": "Āyāma, bho bhāradvāja, yena samaṇo gotamo tenupasaṅkamissāma; upasaṅkamitvā samaṇaṁ gotamaṁ etamatthaṁ pucchissāma. ",
      "english": "Come, let’s go to see him and ask him about this matter. "
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "pali": "Yathā no samaṇo gotamo byākarissati tathā naṁ dhāressāmā”ti. ",
      "english": "As he answers, so we’ll remember it.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "pali": "“Evaṁ, bho”ti kho bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi. ",
      "english": "“Yes, worthy sir,” replied Bhāradvāja. "
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "pali": "Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājā māṇavā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu. ",
      "english": "So they went to the Buddha and exchanged greetings with him. "
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "pali": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu. ",
      "english": "When the greetings and polite conversation were over, they sat down to one side, "
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "pali": "Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhagavantaṁ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi: ",
      "english": "and Vāseṭṭha addressed the Buddha in verse: "
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "pali": "“Anuññātapaṭiññātā, ",
      "english": "“We’re both authorized masters "
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "pali": "tevijjā mayamasmubho; ",
      "english": "of the three Vedas. "
    },
    {
      "number": 28,
      "pali": "Ahaṁ pokkharasātissa, ",
      "english": "I’m a student of Pokkharasāti, "
    },
    {
      "number": 29,
      "pali": "tārukkhassāyaṁ māṇavo. ",
      "english": "and he of Tārukkha. "
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "pali": "Tevijjānaṁ yadakkhātaṁ, ",
      "english": "We’re fully qualified "
    },
    {
      "number": 31,
      "pali": "tatra kevalinosmase; ",
      "english": "in all the Vedic experts teach. "
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "pali": "Padakasmā veyyākaraṇā, ",
      "english": "As philologists and grammarians, "
    },
    {
      "number": 33,
      "pali": "jappe ācariyasādisā; ",
      "english": "we match our tutors in recitation. "
    },
    {
      "number": 34,
      "pali": "Tesaṁ no jātivādasmiṁ, ",
      "english": "We have a dispute "
    },
    {
      "number": 35,
      "pali": "vivādo atthi gotama. ",
      "english": "regarding genealogy. "
    },
    {
      "number": 36,
      "pali": "Jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti, ",
      "english": "For Bhāradvāja says that "
    },
    {
      "number": 37,
      "pali": "bhāradvājo iti bhāsati; ",
      "english": "one is a brahmin due to birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 38,
      "pali": "Ahañca kammunā brūmi, ",
      "english": "but I declare it’s because of one’s deeds. "
    },
    {
      "number": 39,
      "pali": "evaṁ jānāhi cakkhuma. ",
      "english": "Oh Clear-eyed One, know this as our debate. "
    },
    {
      "number": 40,
      "pali": "Te na sakkoma ñāpetuṁ, ",
      "english": "Since neither of us was able "
    },
    {
      "number": 41,
      "pali": "aññamaññaṁ mayaṁ ubho; ",
      "english": "to convince the other, "
    },
    {
      "number": 42,
      "pali": "Bhavantaṁ puṭṭhumāgamā, ",
      "english": "we’ve come to ask you, sir, "
    },
    {
      "number": 43,
      "pali": "sambuddhaṁ iti vissutaṁ. ",
      "english": "renowned as the awakened one. "
    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "pali": "Candaṁ yathā khayātītaṁ, ",
      "english": "As people honor with cupped palms "
    },
    {
      "number": 45,
      "pali": "pecca pañjalikā janā; ",
      "english": "the moon on the cusp of waxing, "
    },
    {
      "number": 46,
      "pali": "Vandamānā namassanti, ",
      "english": "bowing, they revere "
    },
    {
      "number": 47,
      "pali": "lokasmiṁ gotamaṁ. ",
      "english": "Gotama in the world. "
    },
    {
      "number": 48,
      "pali": "Cakkhuṁ loke samuppannaṁ, ",
      "english": "We ask this of Gotama, "
    },
    {
      "number": 49,
      "pali": "mayaṁ pucchāma gotamaṁ; ",
      "english": "the Eye arisen in the world: "
    },
    {
      "number": 50,
      "pali": "Jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti, ",
      "english": "is one a brahmin due to birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 51,
      "pali": "udāhu bhavati kammunā; ",
      "english": "or else because of deeds? "
    },
    {
      "number": 52,
      "pali": "Ajānataṁ no pabrūhi, ",
      "english": "We don’t know, please tell us, "
    },
    {
      "number": 53,
      "pali": "yathā jānemu brāhmaṇan”ti. ",
      "english": "so we can recognize a brahmin.” "
    },
    {
      "number": 54,
      "pali": "“Tesaṁ vo ahaṁ byakkhissaṁ, ",
      "english": "“I shall explain to you,” "
    },
    {
      "number": 55,
      "pali": "(vāseṭṭhāti bhagavā) ",
      "english": "said the Buddha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 56,
      "pali": "Anupubbaṁ yathātathaṁ; ",
      "english": "“accurately and in sequence, "
    },
    {
      "number": 57,
      "pali": "Jātivibhaṅgaṁ pāṇānaṁ, ",
      "english": "the taxonomy of living creatures, "
    },
    {
      "number": 58,
      "pali": "Aññamaññāhi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 59,
      "pali": "Tiṇarukkhepi jānātha, ",
      "english": "Know the grass and trees, "
    },
    {
      "number": 60,
      "pali": "na cāpi paṭijānare; ",
      "english": "though they lack self-awareness. "
    },
    {
      "number": 61,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 62,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 63,
      "pali": "Tato kīṭe paṭaṅge ca, ",
      "english": "Next there are bugs that crawl or fly, "
    },
    {
      "number": 64,
      "pali": "yāva kunthakipillike; ",
      "english": "and so on, to ants and termites. "
    },
    {
      "number": 65,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 66,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 67,
      "pali": "Catuppadepi jānātha, ",
      "english": "Know the quadrupeds, too, "
    },
    {
      "number": 68,
      "pali": "khuddake ca mahallake; ",
      "english": "both small and large. "
    },
    {
      "number": 69,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 70,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 71,
      "pali": "Pādudarepi jānātha, ",
      "english": "Know, too, the long-backed snakes, "
    },
    {
      "number": 72,
      "pali": "urage dīghapiṭṭhike; ",
      "english": "crawling on their bellies. "
    },
    {
      "number": 73,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 74,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 75,
      "pali": "Tato macchepi jānātha, ",
      "english": "Next know the fish, "
    },
    {
      "number": 76,
      "pali": "udake vārigocare; ",
      "english": "whose range is the water. "
    },
    {
      "number": 77,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 78,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 79,
      "pali": "Tato pakkhīpi jānātha, ",
      "english": "Next know the birds, "
    },
    {
      "number": 80,
      "pali": "pattayāne vihaṅgame; ",
      "english": "winged chariots in flight. "
    },
    {
      "number": 81,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ tesaṁ, ",
      "english": "They’re defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 82,
      "pali": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. ",
      "english": "for species are indeed diverse. "
    },
    {
      "number": 83,
      "pali": "Yathā etāsu jātīsu, ",
      "english": "While the differences between these species "
    },
    {
      "number": 84,
      "pali": "liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ puthu; ",
      "english": "are defined by birth, "
    },
    {
      "number": 85,
      "pali": "Evaṁ natthi manussesu, ",
      "english": "the differences between humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 86,
      "pali": "liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ puthu. ",
      "english": "are not defined by birth. "
    },
    {
      "number": 87,
      "pali": "Na kesehi na sīsehi, ",
      "english": "Not by hair nor by head, "
    },
    {
      "number": 88,
      "pali": "na kaṇṇehi na akkhīhi; ",
      "english": "not by ear nor by eye, "
    },
    {
      "number": 89,
      "pali": "Na mukhena na nāsāya, ",
      "english": "not by mouth nor by nose, "
    },
    {
      "number": 90,
      "pali": "na oṭṭhehi bhamūhi vā. ",
      "english": "not by lips nor by eyebrow, "
    },
    {
      "number": 91,
      "pali": "Na gīvāya na aṁsehi, ",
      "english": "not by shoulder nor by neck, "
    },
    {
      "number": 92,
      "pali": "na udarena na piṭṭhiyā; ",
      "english": "not by belly nor by back, "
    },
    {
      "number": 93,
      "pali": "Na soṇiyā na urasā, ",
      "english": "not by buttocks nor by breast, "
    },
    {
      "number": 94,
      "pali": "na sambādhe na methune. ",
      "english": "not by groin nor by genitals, "
    },
    {
      "number": 95,
      "pali": "Na hatthehi na pādehi, ",
      "english": "not by hands nor by feet, "
    },
    {
      "number": 96,
      "pali": "naṅgulīhi nakhehi vā; ",
      "english": "not by fingers nor by nails, "
    },
    {
      "number": 97,
      "pali": "Na jaṅghāhi na ūrūhi, ",
      "english": "not by knees nor by thighs, "
    },
    {
      "number": 98,
      "pali": "na vaṇṇena sarena vā; ",
      "english": "not by color nor by voice: "
    },
    {
      "number": 99,
      "pali": "Liṅgaṁ jātimayaṁ neva, ",
      "english": "none of these are defined by birth "
    },
    {
      "number": 100,
      "pali": "yathā aññāsu jātisu. ",
      "english": "as it is for other species. "
    },
    {
      "number": 101,
      "pali": "Paccattañca sarīresu, ",
      "english": "In specific human bodies "
    },
    {
      "number": 102,
      "pali": "manussesvetaṁ na vijjati; ",
      "english": "you can’t find such distinctions. "
    },
    {
      "number": 103,
      "pali": "Vokārañca manussesu, ",
      "english": "The distinctions among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 104,
      "pali": "samaññāya pavuccati. ",
      "english": "are spoken of by convention. "
    },
    {
      "number": 105,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 106,
      "pali": "gorakkhaṁ upajīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off keeping cattle: "
    },
    {
      "number": 107,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 108,
      "pali": "kassako so na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a farmer, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 109,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 110,
      "pali": "puthusippena jīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off various professions: "
    },
    {
      "number": 111,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 112,
      "pali": "sippiko so na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a professional, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 113,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 114,
      "pali": "vohāraṁ upajīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off trade: "
    },
    {
      "number": 115,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 116,
      "pali": "vāṇijo so na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a trader, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 117,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 118,
      "pali": "parapessena jīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off serving others: "
    },
    {
      "number": 119,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 120,
      "pali": "pessako so na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a servant, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 121,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 122,
      "pali": "adinnaṁ upajīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off stealing: "
    },
    {
      "number": 123,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 124,
      "pali": "coro eso na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a bandit, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 125,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 126,
      "pali": "issatthaṁ upajīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off archery: "
    },
    {
      "number": 127,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 128,
      "pali": "yodhājīvo na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a warrior, not a brahmin. "
    },
    {
      "number": 129,
      "pali": "Yo hi koci manussesu, ",
      "english": "Anyone among humans "
    },
    {
      "number": 130,
      "pali": "porohiccena jīvati; ",
      "english": "who lives off priesthood: "
    },
    {
      "number": 131,
      "pali": "Evaṁ vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
      "english": "know them, Vāseṭṭha, "
    },
    {
      "number": 132,
      "pali": "yājako so na brāhmaṇo. ",
      "english": "as a sacrificer, not a brahmin. "
    },
